7. Precautions

1. Check the IC pin configurations before making connections.
2. Switch off the power supply before changing connections.
3. Ensure that all connections are secure.
4. Apply every input combination carefully.
5. Observe the Difference and Borrow outputs separately.

8. Observation

The Difference and Borrow outputs were observed for all possible input combinations of the half subtractor and full subtractor.

9. Result

The half-subtractor and full-subtractor circuits were studied, and their truth tables were verified.
